WEBVTT

00:01.890 --> 00:05.110
Sing for me, Teika...

00:08.910 --> 00:10.220
Nice to meet you.

00:10.840 --> 00:13.320
My name is Fujiwara no Teika.

00:14.380 --> 00:17.530
Has everyone heard of the Hyakunin Isshu?

00:18.790 --> 00:20.240
Some people may know about Hyakunin Isshu

00:21.910 --> 00:25.370
through games like karuta
and bouzu mekuri.

00:25.370 --> 00:26.330
But...

00:26.330 --> 00:29.360
The original purpose of
the Hyakunin Isshu

00:29.360 --> 00:31.800
was to decorate the sliding doors
at a certain mountain villa.

00:32.300 --> 00:35.650
One poem each, from a hundred
of the finest poets,

00:35.650 --> 00:37.300
for a total of one hundred poems,

00:37.830 --> 00:39.510
and I made the selections.

00:41.780 --> 00:45.730
Since the decision was mine alone,
it's rather obvious what I like,

00:45.730 --> 00:49.110
seeing as there are 43 love poems.

00:46.210 --> 00:49.090
Love 43 Poems

00:46.210 --> 00:49.090
Other 25 Poems
Summer 4 Poems
Winter 6 Poems

00:46.210 --> 00:49.090
Spring 6 Poems
Autumn 16 Poems

00:49.470 --> 00:52.230
Yes, I personally prefer

00:53.480 --> 00:54.500
love poems.

02:45.350 --> 02:46.590
Lovely.

02:46.590 --> 02:48.680
Oh, Narihira-dono.

02:49.180 --> 02:51.610
Did one of the ladies catch your fancy?

02:51.610 --> 02:54.220
I pity the damsel who has caught the eye

02:54.220 --> 02:56.120
of such a transcendent womanizer.

02:57.270 --> 02:58.650
That's quite harsh.

02:59.450 --> 03:01.390
So, which lady is it?

03:01.390 --> 03:03.490
The one in the center

03:04.840 --> 03:06.990
That's Fujiwara no Takaiko-sama.

03:07.610 --> 03:09.370
She's Nagara-sama's daughter,

03:09.370 --> 03:11.210
descended from the
northern Fujiwara house.

03:11.980 --> 03:13.160
Nagara-sama's daughter...

03:25.830 --> 03:29.020
Takaiko & Narihira

03:25.830 --> 03:29.020
The Honorable Ariwara no Narihira

03:29.610 --> 03:32.390
Takaiko-sama!  Takaiko-sama!

03:32.910 --> 03:35.110
There is a letter from that man.

03:35.430 --> 03:36.780
Again?

03:37.160 --> 03:40.530
He hasn't given up since
the Gosechi Dance.

03:40.530 --> 03:43.300
You should stop carrying those messages.

03:43.300 --> 03:47.710
But it's a letter from
Ariwara no Narihira-sama;

03:47.710 --> 03:49.370
I could never refuse him.

03:49.680 --> 03:52.640
Well, what kind of poem did
he write for you today?

03:52.640 --> 03:53.960
Please read it!

03:56.720 --> 04:00.980
Were I the wind, unfettered
and free, to breeze past

04:00.980 --> 04:03.990
the screens and behold what lies within.

04:06.080 --> 04:08.050
If I could become the wind,

04:08.050 --> 04:11.780
these walls could never stop
me from coming to see you.

04:14.020 --> 04:18.250
Excuse me, you ignore your
mistress and start daydreaming.

04:18.600 --> 04:22.990
But Narihira-sama's
charm is transcendent.

04:22.990 --> 04:25.610
It's like a dream come
true to be carrying messages

04:25.610 --> 04:28.590
of love between him and Takaiko-sama.

04:28.590 --> 04:31.040
I've never been so grateful to serve.

04:31.040 --> 04:33.250
Just take this back to him.

04:33.940 --> 04:41.220
Were you the wind, only to
be shunned by the screens.

04:42.450 --> 04:44.900
It doesn't matter if you become the wind.

04:44.900 --> 04:47.530
No one's going to let you sneak inside.

04:47.530 --> 04:48.470
Too bad for you.

04:48.920 --> 04:51.830
Oh, this is a nasty poem.

04:51.830 --> 04:54.900
You could have been nicer...

04:54.900 --> 04:57.430
Do you mean to insult me?

04:57.430 --> 04:58.190
Huh?

04:59.760 --> 05:01.570
I'm sure that he's quite handsome,

05:01.570 --> 05:03.870
given the attention he receives,

05:04.540 --> 05:07.490
but he's no more than a
womanizer with a pretty face,

05:08.770 --> 05:13.090
unworthy of spending a
single night with me.

05:14.380 --> 05:16.820
Yes. I am the daughter of Nagara,

05:16.820 --> 05:19.600
descended from the
northern Fujiwara house.

05:20.180 --> 05:23.710
Once the emperor has come of age,

05:24.640 --> 05:27.050
I will become his bride, his queen.

05:30.390 --> 05:32.750
Oh, and the moon was so beautiful...

05:34.930 --> 05:36.550
Good evening.

05:38.060 --> 05:40.810
No!

05:40.810 --> 05:41.950
Quiet.

05:42.380 --> 05:43.230
Who are you?!

05:43.910 --> 05:45.190
The wind.

05:45.670 --> 05:46.550
Wind?

05:47.430 --> 05:49.710
Have you forgotten the name

05:50.450 --> 05:53.680
of the foolish man who proclaimed
he was driven by his burning love

05:54.500 --> 05:57.620
to become the wind and come see you?

06:00.220 --> 06:01.730
Na-Narihira-dono?!

06:01.730 --> 06:02.420
Yes.

06:02.810 --> 06:04.230
Why are you here?

06:04.230 --> 06:06.510
I came here to accept your challenge.

06:06.510 --> 06:08.760
F-Foolishness!

06:08.760 --> 06:10.260
Do you realize where you are?!

06:10.580 --> 06:14.060
Well, I would prefer to take
you outside, if you don't mind?

06:14.420 --> 06:15.450
Don't be absurd!

06:15.450 --> 06:18.770
D-Do you realize who I am...

06:20.140 --> 06:22.060
H-He's going to get me!

06:22.430 --> 06:26.510
Namu amida butsu!

06:27.530 --> 06:28.280
Huh?

06:31.800 --> 06:35.210
You don't have to be so scared.
I won't do anything.

06:35.760 --> 06:37.370
Your responses were so hostile,

06:37.370 --> 06:40.370
so I thought I might tease you a bit.

06:41.950 --> 06:44.630
It seems you aren't too concerned
about controlling your voice.

06:45.800 --> 06:47.120
No!

06:47.120 --> 06:49.740
You won't win any hearts that way.

06:49.740 --> 06:52.820
That was because you suddenly showed up.

06:52.820 --> 06:55.140
Well, I suppose that's not a concern.

06:56.100 --> 06:56.940
What?

06:57.990 --> 07:02.010
Fair skin concealed by a crimson robe.

07:03.020 --> 07:04.280
You are beautiful...

07:06.070 --> 07:08.900
The world was never graced by

07:08.900 --> 07:11.960
such beauty in the age of the ancient gods.

07:12.970 --> 07:15.030
When I first saw you,

07:15.030 --> 07:18.670
I was entranced by the sight
of you in crimson garb.

07:19.420 --> 07:23.330
Now that I am so close,
my love can only grow.

07:24.340 --> 07:26.030
What?  Um...

07:26.030 --> 07:30.730
While you may be easy on the
eyes, there's no substance.

07:30.730 --> 07:31.430
Huh?

07:31.870 --> 07:33.230
Given the gap between

07:33.230 --> 07:35.390
what's on the outside and
what's on the inside,

07:35.390 --> 07:39.640
your body must be rather lacking.

07:41.150 --> 07:42.790
You're nothing but a pretty face.

07:44.010 --> 07:45.590
Farewell, then.

07:46.420 --> 07:48.750
Please keep what happened
tonight a secret.

07:48.750 --> 07:50.520
Ho—  Ho—

07:50.520 --> 07:52.030
Hold it right there!

07:52.570 --> 07:55.030
You're the one who's nothing
more than a pretty face!

07:55.030 --> 07:57.890
I am not just a pretty face!

07:57.890 --> 07:59.870
Then you're nothing but a pretty mouth?

08:00.750 --> 08:02.580
You imbecile!

08:03.110 --> 08:07.270
Why don't you see for yourself
if my body is lacking or not?!

08:07.270 --> 08:07.800
Huh?

08:12.980 --> 08:16.020
You're a lot cuter than I expected,

08:16.020 --> 08:18.850
but we'll have to wait until next time.

08:19.820 --> 08:21.280
I'll be back.

08:42.880 --> 08:44.080
Understood?

08:44.470 --> 08:47.370
You are not toying with me.

08:47.370 --> 08:50.130
I am toying with you.

08:50.130 --> 08:54.010
You say that every time we meet.

08:54.750 --> 08:56.810
I want to make sure that it's clear.

08:57.240 --> 08:58.520
That's sad.

08:59.370 --> 09:01.100
I'm serious about this.

09:03.330 --> 09:04.640
S-Serious?!

09:04.640 --> 09:06.630
B-But aren't you...

09:06.630 --> 09:10.970
Or you're saying that you're
the type who fools around?

09:10.970 --> 09:13.280
Of course not!

09:13.280 --> 09:18.620
Then you shouldn't demean
yourself with lies.

09:21.460 --> 09:22.330
Come here.

09:27.490 --> 09:29.380
Why am I letting him take the lead?

09:29.590 --> 09:30.370
Hey!

09:31.750 --> 09:32.900
That hurts.

09:32.900 --> 09:34.050
Do you understand?

09:34.700 --> 09:36.880
One day, I will be the emperor's queen.

09:37.360 --> 09:40.430
Once that happens, we will
not be allowed to meet.

09:41.200 --> 09:44.740
You may say that you're serious,
but in reality, you're helpless.

09:45.580 --> 09:46.670
Yes...

09:48.760 --> 09:53.990
Your marriage is crucial to the
Fujiwara house for political reasons.

09:53.990 --> 09:58.160
I have no way to stop that.

09:59.340 --> 10:01.310
That's why I'm just toying with you.

10:02.990 --> 10:05.620
Yes, it is my duty to marry the emperor.

10:05.990 --> 10:08.160
I was always proud of that fact.

10:08.160 --> 10:10.050
So why...

10:11.800 --> 10:13.250
Shall we elope?

10:13.780 --> 10:14.760
Huh?

10:14.760 --> 10:16.220
Elope.

10:30.420 --> 10:32.330
Ta-Takaiko.

10:32.330 --> 10:33.240
Yes?

10:33.240 --> 10:34.730
Could you take off your clothes?

10:35.060 --> 10:35.940
Huh?

10:35.940 --> 10:38.820
W-Wait!  What are you thinking?!

10:38.820 --> 10:40.860
I refuse to do it outside!

10:40.860 --> 10:42.470
That's not what I meant!

10:42.430 --> 10:46.620
Takaiko's clothes
weigh approximately
10 kilograms

10:42.470 --> 10:43.360
You're too heavy!

10:43.360 --> 10:45.210
How dare you tell a
girl that she's heavy?!

10:45.210 --> 10:46.620
I meant your clothes!

10:47.350 --> 10:50.210
Fine, I'll walk by myself.

10:52.460 --> 10:54.540
This is rather unbecoming, but it works.

10:54.540 --> 10:57.260
You'll have an easier time  if you
take off your outer garments.

10:57.260 --> 10:58.380
I refuse.

10:58.810 --> 11:02.390
Don't you prefer to see
me wearing crimson?

11:05.980 --> 11:07.150
Pretty...

11:07.150 --> 11:08.210
What's this?

11:08.210 --> 11:09.440
Dew.

11:09.790 --> 11:10.730
What about this?

11:10.730 --> 11:12.460
Laughing gym.

11:12.460 --> 11:15.060
They're poisonous, so you
don't want to eat them.

11:15.060 --> 11:16.720
What happens if you eat one?

11:16.720 --> 11:19.260
In some cases, you might die.

11:19.260 --> 11:21.240
Oh, dear.  How dreadful,

11:21.240 --> 11:23.370
but I have nothing to worry
about with you around.

11:28.420 --> 11:31.440
I love you, Takaiko-sama.

11:32.020 --> 11:32.960
And I, you.

11:34.710 --> 11:37.050
It appears that Mototsune-sama
has come for you.

11:38.240 --> 11:39.420
My brother?

11:39.760 --> 11:41.680
We must escape!  Hurry!

11:44.980 --> 11:46.130
Narihira?

11:50.110 --> 11:51.140
Go home.

11:58.330 --> 11:59.630
Coward!

12:00.220 --> 12:01.590
Coward...

12:07.860 --> 12:10.620
How many years have passed?

12:11.690 --> 12:14.290
This will be our first reunion.

12:15.870 --> 12:17.990
I am now the Emperor's mother.

12:18.600 --> 12:22.360
You are one of the Emperor's generals.

12:24.930 --> 12:29.740
Many tears were shed,
but that was in the past.

12:30.360 --> 12:33.100
You can no longer sway my heart.

12:34.280 --> 12:36.990
Now that my passion has cooled,

12:36.990 --> 12:39.650
I wouldn't mind a casual tryst like old times.

12:40.640 --> 12:42.580
I have heard that you're an

12:42.580 --> 12:46.120
incompetent general who can only compose poetry.

12:46.120 --> 12:47.580
Ta-Takaiko-sama...

12:47.580 --> 12:51.000
Could you recite one for us?

12:52.570 --> 12:55.790
Well, what kind of poem
do you have for us?

12:56.440 --> 12:59.460
Then I have a poem for
the art on this screen.

13:06.450 --> 13:10.810
Impassionate gods have
never seen the crimson

13:10.810 --> 13:14.310
that lies in the Tatsuta River.

13:14.880 --> 13:17.810
Such a romantic description
of a simple screen.

13:17.810 --> 13:19.650
Narihira-dono does not disappoint.

13:19.980 --> 13:22.850
He describes the autumn
leaves as red.

13:22.850 --> 13:24.570
That's beautiful.

13:25.630 --> 13:27.110
Red...

13:32.320 --> 13:35.530
The others believe that he is
referring to the landscape...

13:36.430 --> 13:38.790
It seems that he's grown up.

13:38.790 --> 13:41.170
...crimson that lies in the Tatsuta River.

13:42.000 --> 13:42.880
Hmm?

13:42.880 --> 13:43.760
In?

13:45.610 --> 13:48.310
Not even the gods would have known

13:48.310 --> 13:51.470
that the red garb

13:51.470 --> 13:54.270
concealed such an unparalleled woman.

13:55.540 --> 13:57.140
Th-This man is...

13:59.090 --> 13:59.900
Mother?

14:01.800 --> 14:02.980
Yes.

14:03.900 --> 14:08.990
I don't want to forget the
feelings that we shared.

14:15.090 --> 14:18.540
Ariwara no Narihira was a paramount
playboy of the Heian period.

14:19.010 --> 14:23.020
At the time, romance was considered

14:23.020 --> 14:25.050
classy entertainment and cultural.

14:25.590 --> 14:30.520
However, Narihira had an older
brother who was his opposite.

14:39.650 --> 14:40.630
Hiroko.

14:41.660 --> 14:44.520
What is it, Yukihira-sama?

14:44.520 --> 14:45.910
You must be tired.

14:45.910 --> 14:49.110
The others can finish here,
so go get some rest.

14:49.840 --> 14:51.570
I cannot do that.

14:51.870 --> 14:54.540
Everyone has come here to celebrate

14:54.540 --> 14:57.540
your promotion to Head Governor of Inaba.

14:57.540 --> 14:59.150
I see...

14:59.150 --> 15:01.720
Forgive me, but I must
head out for a while.

15:02.270 --> 15:03.750
Oh, where are you going?

15:05.070 --> 15:06.740
To see Narihira.

15:07.210 --> 15:10.220
Yukihira and Hiroko

15:07.210 --> 15:10.220
Councilor Yukihira

15:11.100 --> 15:13.300
He's been ill since the new year began.

15:13.900 --> 15:15.200
I'm going to see how he's doing.

15:15.200 --> 15:17.520
A very kind pretense.

15:18.070 --> 15:20.600
You're going to scold him again, yes?

15:20.600 --> 15:22.400
Oh, you knew?

15:22.890 --> 15:27.960
Ki no Aritsune-sama stopped by earlier.

15:27.960 --> 15:30.410
Every time I see him, he tells me

15:30.410 --> 15:34.280
that he should never have
wedded his daughter

15:34.280 --> 15:35.700
to that heartless scoundrel.

15:36.190 --> 15:42.040
When I hear him complaining,
I realize how blessed I am in love.

15:42.480 --> 15:43.690
Blessed?

15:43.690 --> 15:48.010
Our relationship is smooth
because we both put in effort.

15:48.480 --> 15:50.720
That's what my brother
and sister-in-law lack.

15:51.310 --> 15:52.620
However,

15:53.870 --> 15:56.820
I feel blessed to have met someone who

15:56.820 --> 16:00.600
I cared enough about
to spend that effort.

16:02.160 --> 16:04.860
Blessed to have a husband who will
be departing for distant Inaba?

16:05.270 --> 16:09.020
Yes, I'm fortunate to have a
loyal husband who's climbing

16:09.020 --> 16:10.450
the ladder very quickly.

16:11.380 --> 16:14.840
She has no complaints about her
husband leaving her behind?

16:15.300 --> 16:18.690
She's so understanding
that I have to worry...

16:18.690 --> 16:20.820
Am I pushing her too hard?

16:22.590 --> 16:24.880
But for now, I need to
worry about Narihira:

16:25.640 --> 16:29.200
my significantly younger
brother by a different mother.

16:30.940 --> 16:33.010
Are you in good health, Yukihira?

16:33.010 --> 16:34.580
Yes, Father.

16:34.580 --> 16:35.470
Who is that boy?

16:35.940 --> 16:38.270
Your younger brother, Narihira.

16:38.270 --> 16:41.460
He wanted to meet his older brother.

16:41.460 --> 16:42.810
Hello, Brother.

16:43.210 --> 16:44.260
Hello.

16:44.260 --> 16:46.060
Would you like to play
kemari in the yard?

16:46.280 --> 16:49.570
No, I want to see your room.

16:49.570 --> 16:50.880
M-My room?

16:50.880 --> 16:53.620
I don't have my own room.

16:53.620 --> 16:54.530
Why not?

16:54.790 --> 16:58.130
Well, our home isn't that big.

16:58.130 --> 16:59.740
I share a room with the
rest of the family.

17:00.040 --> 17:01.320
Oh...

17:01.320 --> 17:04.750
So you don't have as much because
of your mother's lineage.

17:04.750 --> 17:07.000
It's too bad you weren't born in my home.

17:10.780 --> 17:14.470
Thinking back, our first
meeting was a disaster.

17:14.470 --> 17:17.050
Now, how should I approach this?

17:22.070 --> 17:23.390
Narihira.

17:23.390 --> 17:25.240
Yes, Brother.

17:25.240 --> 17:26.100
Good to see you.

17:26.380 --> 17:30.830
I heard that you were ill,
but you seem to be doing fine.

17:30.830 --> 17:32.820
No, I'm very ill.

17:33.610 --> 17:35.280
I'm sick at heart.

17:35.280 --> 17:36.770
Oh...

17:37.630 --> 17:40.800
I was lamenting my lowly rank.

17:40.800 --> 17:42.730
A lie.

17:42.730 --> 17:45.450
You've never cared about rank.

17:45.450 --> 17:47.940
I certainly do care.

17:47.940 --> 17:53.090
However, there is something more
important to me than my job.

17:53.370 --> 17:54.750
What's that?

17:55.360 --> 17:57.340
Anyway, Brother...

17:57.340 --> 17:58.540
I heard that you were

17:58.540 --> 18:00.800
just promoted to Head
Governor of Inaba this year.

18:01.120 --> 18:01.940
Yes.

18:01.940 --> 18:04.030
Congratulations.

18:04.520 --> 18:07.060
Will you be taking my dear
sister-in-law with you?

18:07.060 --> 18:10.160
No, she will stay in the
capital and tend to our home.

18:10.160 --> 18:11.820
I feel bad for her.

18:12.120 --> 18:13.310
Do not worry,

18:13.310 --> 18:16.950
I will be sure to comfort
her in your absence.

18:16.950 --> 18:19.240
You should spend less time
worrying about other men's wives

18:19.240 --> 18:21.370
and focus on your own!

18:22.230 --> 18:23.620
Listen to me.

18:23.620 --> 18:27.010
A boat can only sail when
there is a port to return to.

18:27.010 --> 18:28.750
At this rate, you'll be shipwrecked.

18:29.170 --> 18:30.700
You need to spend more effort-

18:30.700 --> 18:31.790
Brother.

18:33.100 --> 18:35.780
Happiness comes in many forms.

18:35.780 --> 18:40.890
Your happiness is not mine,
and the opposite is also true.

18:42.000 --> 18:44.970
I would prefer that you not
force your way of life upon me.

18:47.690 --> 18:52.030
When our father, Prince Abo,
died, I was twenty-five.

18:52.620 --> 18:54.550
Narihira was eighteen.

18:55.730 --> 18:58.540
Our father was born as the
son of Emperor Heizei

18:56.760 --> 18:59.360
Kusuko Incident

18:58.540 --> 19:00.900
and became a victim of politics.

19:00.510 --> 19:03.010
Jowa Incident

19:00.940 --> 19:03.430
His struggles never eased
until he passed away.

19:04.550 --> 19:06.440
Our father was a hardworking man.

19:07.730 --> 19:11.290
It's possible that after seeing
what happened to our father,

19:12.650 --> 19:15.400
Narihira determined that hard
work doesn't always pay off,

19:16.270 --> 19:18.250
so it would be better
to live a free life.

19:19.450 --> 19:23.100
However, I never believed
that our father was wrong.

19:24.010 --> 19:25.950
I will work hard while refusing

19:25.950 --> 19:28.680
to be influenced by
surrounding circumstances.

19:29.250 --> 19:31.560
That is how I honor
my father's memory.

19:35.700 --> 19:37.120
Yukihira-sama.

19:38.180 --> 19:39.810
Yukihira-sama.

19:41.530 --> 19:44.930
You need to begin
preparing for your trip.

19:44.930 --> 19:46.700
Oh, yes...

19:48.190 --> 19:49.470
I just remembered.

19:49.470 --> 19:52.010
Narihira said that he
would pay you a visit.

19:52.010 --> 19:52.910
Oh, my.

19:52.910 --> 19:54.340
He was probably joking,

19:54.910 --> 19:58.540
but if he does come, welcome him
appropriately before sending him off.

19:58.540 --> 20:01.340
And what would be appropriate?

20:01.340 --> 20:02.900
That would be...

20:02.900 --> 20:04.080
...whatever's appropriate.

20:05.370 --> 20:07.890
Anyway, if something
comes up, let me know.

20:08.620 --> 20:10.030
I'll come flying over.

20:10.030 --> 20:13.940
You shouldn't make promises
that could cost you your life.

20:15.110 --> 20:17.380
Inaba is far away.

20:17.380 --> 20:19.110
Your first priority is your work.

20:19.110 --> 20:21.590
Do not worry about me.

20:23.130 --> 20:24.440
Hiroko.

20:24.440 --> 20:25.030
Yes.

20:25.030 --> 20:27.060
You're mistaken.

20:28.820 --> 20:33.420
I always have my priorities straight.

20:33.900 --> 20:35.580
It's a short trip from
Inaba to the capital.

20:36.240 --> 20:37.620
Don't underestimate me.

20:39.010 --> 20:41.920
Then please stay here forever.

20:42.330 --> 20:44.690
If you truly care about me,

20:45.340 --> 20:47.480
that should be simple enough.

20:48.670 --> 20:49.810
Very well.

20:53.010 --> 20:54.370
Is this what you want?

20:54.370 --> 20:55.600
Yukihira-sama...

20:56.050 --> 20:59.130
I feel much better, now that I've been
relieved of my responsibilities.

21:00.160 --> 21:03.600
Let's discuss how we'll
spend the rest of our lives.

21:04.610 --> 21:06.420
Or would you rather we go back to bed?

21:07.760 --> 21:09.030
Yukihira-sama...

21:09.410 --> 21:11.390
Please stop teasing me.

21:12.810 --> 21:15.580
Yes, who's teasing who here?

21:15.580 --> 21:18.550
I'm grateful for your concern,

21:18.550 --> 21:20.340
but do not worry.

21:21.290 --> 21:24.760
From the moment I married you,
I was prepared to do

21:24.760 --> 21:27.220
whatever was necessary to support you.

21:28.300 --> 21:29.850
You're so strong...

21:30.590 --> 21:32.140
That's why I...

21:32.680 --> 21:36.230
Why I love you so much.

21:37.010 --> 21:39.630
I'm not strong at all.

21:39.630 --> 21:43.400
I can only be strong because I have you.

21:43.880 --> 21:45.510
I am the same.

21:46.330 --> 21:48.280
Nothing scares me

21:48.790 --> 21:50.290
because I have you waiting for me.

21:52.340 --> 21:53.940
Note that though we may be apart,

21:53.940 --> 21:56.730
if I am to hear that you pine for me

21:57.390 --> 22:00.930
as the Inaba mountain pines,
I shall return to you.

22:02.610 --> 22:04.190
I must go,

22:04.750 --> 22:07.800
but if you call my name,
I promise to return.

22:08.710 --> 22:10.000
I promise.

22:12.090 --> 22:14.370
Our father demoted
Narihira and myself to

22:14.370 --> 22:17.480
retainers so we would not
be targeted by the coup.

22:18.320 --> 22:20.400
Narihira, I hope that you're able to find

22:21.230 --> 22:25.250
something you can truly care about.

22:27.440 --> 22:32.480
Narihira would meet
Takaiko five years later.

22:32.950 --> 22:34.950
Poetic Tale 1:

24:05.000 --> 25:00.000
Next Episode

24:05.000 --> 25:00.000
Sadaakira and Yasuko

24:05.000 --> 25:00.000
Emperor Yozei

24:06.710 --> 24:12.370
Feel love deepen over time,

24:14.100 --> 24:18.260
like a stream widening into a river.
